'''Crazed Moneko''' (狂乱のもねこ降臨, ''Kyōran no Moneko Kōrin'', '''Frenzy Moneko Advent''') is a set of special stages that was added in [[Version 6.10 Update|Version 6.10]] and appears on the 28th day of each month. It is unlocked after clearing [[Empire of Cats]]. Each of the first three stages drops a [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Cat Ticket]] on initial completion. The fourth stage, which is accessed directly from the third, has a guaranteed chance of dropping [[Crazed Moneko (Special Cat)|Crazed Moneko]].

